Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.87,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Looked to be down and out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她看起来已陷入绝境
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.18,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Was facing a 5-2 deficit{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当时 她以二比五落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.55,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in the second set after dropping the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那是她先丢首盘后的第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:12.18,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号上午 中网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.53,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年的冠军斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:17.81,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}先丢一盘 第二盘又{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:21.54,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}维基奇只要再赢一局 就能结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:44.40,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big hitting from both players on that point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分 两个人都打得很有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.46,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}维基奇不只从底线加力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:49.23,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}还突然把球放短
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.39,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克得从底线往前追
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:53.34,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}节奏一下就变了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.32,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}看这次变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:11.13,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A little change of pace, a little trickery from Vekic there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N维基奇这一下变了节奏 耍了个巧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:22.14,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Misses that forehand, does Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克这记正手失误了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:24.56,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, first set goes to Donna Vekic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样 唐娜 维基奇拿下了第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:29.32,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Hasn't been in the fourth round of a 1000 tournament in over a year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一年多没进过{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.82,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, she's halfway to changing that narrative. 6-4.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N改变局面已走了一半 六比四
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.14,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:36.97,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}第二盘也没有立刻好转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:38.95,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:40.54,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}底线相持还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.91,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}维基奇的小球又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:06.83,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:25.39,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There it is again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.26,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Donna Vekic drop shot special.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N唐娜 维基奇拿手的放小球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:31.42,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}随后 她落后到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.35,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}维基奇第一次发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:35.26,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}却一分也没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.08,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克连得四分破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:40.56,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}再保住自己的发球局 追到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:44.41,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 维基奇第二次为比赛发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:46.02,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}这次只拿到一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.85,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克又破了 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.26,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}官方两版集锦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:53.25,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}都没有收录这段追分的完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:56.32,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}之后双方保发 比赛进入抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.78,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A crushing return winner from Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克接发直接得分！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:09.82,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Donna Vekic with two chances to close out the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N维基奇两次有机会结束比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.04,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Unable to do so.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N却没能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:13.60,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Iga Swiatek storms back, and...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克强势追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:17.09,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a tiebreak she played.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个抢七 她打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:20.70,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Seven points to none in that tiebreak.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一局抢七 七比零
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:22.12,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}抢七最后这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.83,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}她迎着发球直接回击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.72,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}接发就打出制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.88,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 一分没让
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.16,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}刚才还在出局边缘 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:32.84,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}比赛重新回到同一起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:37.01,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}决胜盘 斯瓦泰克又以{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:38.53,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}先保发追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:40.59,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}再去争对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:44.00,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}先回到{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 看这一段争夺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.13,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That deserves a smile.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球 值得笑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:07.78,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's just the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球刚好压线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:10.70,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Break opportunity.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.39,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Iga Swiatek gets the break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:29.83,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}两个人都打出{\fs78}37{\fs68}记制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:33.06,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}斯瓦泰克的非受迫失误却少了{\fs78}6{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.57,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}赢下这个接发局后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:37.93,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}她把{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}的领先扩大到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.43,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}从{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.16,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}她连赢最后{\fs78}5{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:44.00,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}中间两局的完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.01,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}官方集锦没有收录
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.56,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}下一轮对约维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.00,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}她能把这股势头带下去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.59,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}最后一分 交给现场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.63,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And then the comeback is complete.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N逆转就这样完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:11.37,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to finish for Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克精彩地结束比赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.18,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Looked to be down and out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她看起来已陷入绝境
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.49,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Was facing a 5-2 deficit{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当时 她以二比五落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.86,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in the second set after dropping the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那是她先丢首盘后的第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:20.55,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Storms all the way back.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她一路强势追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:23.50,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wins the tiebreak without dropping a point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下抢七 一分都没让
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.57,TL,,0,0,356,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And then she wins the third set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接着 她又赢下了第三盘
